[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mOne Country.iso_code joins this to health-systems-kg & surveillance-kg\u001b[0m —     \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m social/environmental drivers, response                                       \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m capacity, and outbreak signal answered on a single engine, one Cypher query. \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
